The AMT is a MULTIPLE-licenses software: Most of the files are licensed under the GPL version 3.0, but some files are licensed differently. Each file contains a separate boilerplate showing the actual license. For files being NOT under GPL3, the boilerplate is displayed on the first run. 

The directory "licenses" contains the boilerplates and full texts of the licenses used within the AMT. 

For more information contact the AMT Team. 
